  "legal_privacy_intro": "Below you will find the privacy information for the use of the DFS Complaint App.",
  "legal_privacy_0_text_prefix": "These notices apply to the DFS Complaint App (web application and mobile app for recording, processing and tracking complaints). They replace the general website sections where the app is concerned. For content outside the app, the privacy policy published there applies in addition: ",
  "legal_privacy_title": "Privacy",
  "legal_privacy_heading": "Privacy Policy for the DFS Complaint App",
  "legal_privacy_0_title": "Introduction and Scope",
  "legal_privacy_0_text": "This privacy policy applies to the DFS Complaint App, a web and mobile application of DFS-Diamon GmbH for recording, processing and tracking complaints. It replaces the general privacy information of the corporate website insofar as app functions are concerned. For all content outside the app, the privacy policy published on the website applies additionally. The app includes: a Flutter web frontend (Vercel, region Frankfurt/EU), a Flutter mobile app, a Node.js/Edge backend (Vercel, Frankfurt/EU), an Upstash Redis database (EU/Frankfurt), system email functions, upload functionality and role/user management.",
  "legal_privacy_1_title": "Controller",
  "legal_privacy_1_text": "DFS-Diamon GmbH, Ländenstraße 1, D-93339 Riedenburg, Phone: +49 (0) 9442 91 89-0, Email: info@dfs-diamon.de.",
  "legal_privacy_2_title": "Data Protection Officer",
  "legal_privacy_2_text": "Michael Gruber, BSP-SECURITY, Thundorferstraße 10, D-93047 Regensburg, Email: info@bsp-security.de.",
  "legal_privacy_3_title": "Types of Data We Process",
  "legal_privacy_3_1_title": "Registration and Account Data",
  "legal_privacy_3_1_text": "First and last name, company/practice/laboratory, country, email address, password (hashed), gate password/approval status, date and time of registration, IP address.",
  "legal_privacy_3_2_title": "Login and Authentication Data",
  "legal_privacy_3_2_text": "Email address, password hash, JWT token, login timestamp, device and browser information.",
  "legal_privacy_3_3_title": "Complaint Data",
  "legal_privacy_3_3_text": "Ticket number, product and customer data, description of the defect, attachments (e.g., photos, PDFs), history and status timeline, assigned representatives, internal processing notes.",
  "legal_privacy_3_4_title": "System and Security Data",
  "legal_privacy_3_4_text": "IP addresses, timestamps, technical logs, error messages, browser information.",
  "legal_privacy_3_5_title": "Representative and Administrator Data",
  "legal_privacy_3_5_text": "Name, email, region, communication and processing logs, role and permission data.",
  "legal_privacy_4_title": "Purposes of Processing",
  "legal_privacy_4_text": "Provision and operation of the app; execution of the registration and gate-password approval process; use of complaint management functions; communication related to complaints; process documentation and traceability; operation, maintenance and security of systems; detection and prevention of misuse; compliance with legal obligations.",
  "legal_privacy_5_title": "Legal Bases",
  "legal_privacy_5_text": "Article 6(1)(b) GDPR (performance of contractual or pre-contractual obligations); Article 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest, including IT security and efficient process handling); Article 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent, e.g., optional features); Article 6(1)(c) GDPR (legal obligations).",
  "legal_privacy_6_title": "Hosting, Infrastructure and Processors",
  "legal_privacy_6_1_title": "Vercel (Hosting of Frontend and Backend)",
  "legal_privacy_6_1_text": "Provider: Vercel Inc. Data processing location: Frankfurt (eu-fra1). Data processed: IP address, API calls, technical logs, timestamps, user agent. Data processing agreement under Article 28 GDPR: https://vercel.com/legal/dpa. All data transmissions are encrypted (TLS).",
  "legal_privacy_6_2_title": "Upstash Redis (Data Storage)",
  "legal_privacy_6_2_text": "The app uses Upstash Redis for storing all relevant data, including user accounts, complaints, attachments, tokens and representative data. Data region: Frankfurt/EU. Data processing agreement: https://upstash.com/trust/dpa.pdf. Communication is always encrypted (TLS).",
  "legal_privacy_6_3_title": "Email Sending",
  "legal_privacy_6_3_text": "System emails are sent via DFS mail servers or EU-based SMTP providers. When using external providers, a data processing agreement under Article 28 GDPR is in place.",
  "legal_privacy_6_4_title": "Flutter / Google",
  "legal_privacy_6_4_text": "Flutter itself does not process personal data. No tracking or analytics (Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics) is used.",
  "legal_privacy_7_title": "Processing Within the EU",
  "legal_privacy_7_text": "All personal data is processed exclusively within the European Union. No transfers to third countries take place unless explicitly stated and adequate safeguards are in place. All data transmissions are encrypted (TLS).",
  "legal_privacy_8_title": "Cookies, Local Storage & App Storage",
  "legal_privacy_8_text": "The app does not use tracking cookies. Only technically necessary information such as JWT tokens, language settings, UI and session data, and temporary input buffers are stored. Legal basis: Article 6(1)(f) GDPR.",
  "legal_privacy_9_title": "Uploads and Attachments",
  "legal_privacy_9_text": "Uploaded files such as photos, PDFs or supplementary documents are stored in the database and used exclusively for processing the complaint. No data is shared with third parties.",
  "legal_privacy_10_title": "Email Communication",
  "legal_privacy_10_text": "The app sends system messages such as registration confirmations, gate password emails, approval notifications, complaint status updates, follow-up questions and admin notifications. Content and scope depend on the respective function.",
  "legal_privacy_11_title": "Deletion Periods",
  "legal_privacy_11_1_title": "User Accounts",
  "legal_privacy_11_1_text": "Deletion possible at any time upon request. Deactivated accounts are deleted within 30 days unless legal retention periods apply.",
  "legal_privacy_11_2_title": "Complaint Data",
  "legal_privacy_11_2_text": "Retention according to commercial and tax regulations (6–10 years) and MDR requirements for Class IIa medical devices (at least 10 years).",
  "legal_privacy_11_3_title": "System and Security Logs",
  "legal_privacy_11_3_text": "Automatic deletion after a maximum of 90 days.",
  "legal_privacy_11_4_title": "Gate Passwords",
  "legal_privacy_11_4_text": "Automatic deletion after approval or expiration.",
  "legal_privacy_12_title": "Disclosure of Data to Third Parties",
  "legal_privacy_12_text": "Data is only disclosed when necessary for complaint processing, when legally required, or when consent has been given. No transfer to advertising or tracking providers.",
  "legal_privacy_13_title": "Automated Decision-Making / Profiling",
  "legal_privacy_13_text": "No automated decision-making under Article 22 GDPR and no profiling takes place within the app.",
  "legal_privacy_14_title": "Rights of Data Subjects",
  "legal_privacy_14_text": "Data subjects have the rights set out in Articles 15–22 GDPR: access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability, objection and withdrawal of consent according to Article 7(3) GDPR. Rights can be exercised at any time via the Data Protection Officer.",
  "legal_privacy_15_title": "Right to Lodge a Complaint",
  "legal_privacy_15_text": "The competent supervisory authority is: Bavarian State Office for Data Protection Supervision (BayLDA), Promenade 27, 91522 Ansbach, Email: poststelle@lda.bayern.de.",
  "legal_privacy_16_title": "Changes to This Privacy Policy",
  "legal_privacy_16_text": "We reserve the right to update this privacy policy if technical or legal requirements change. The current version is always available in the app.",
